## Plan

_Written by `claude-8` (claude, `opus`, strong) ([run](https://github.com/Jlore-Studios/JackiOh/actions/runs/40446529749)) before anyone built this. The night bot's builder starts from this section: edit it here to change the plan._

## Goal

The landing gets a quiet quests bookmark, for an active signed-in account while `ECONOMY_LIVE` is on. It hangs off `.landing-ctas` with a glyph and the held count. A click unrolls a parchment panel with `/collection`'s rows over the content below. The panel reads again when a quest falls due, offers Try again after a failed read, and closes on a click, Escape or a press outside. Reduced motion makes it instant. Ruling R2035000 records it.

